      "contractConsumer": "LibraryEscrow.settleReturn reads chain time, clamps fees to the deposit, pays the configured treasury and borrower, then emits ReturnSettled",
      "backendConsumer": "N-5DF verifies canonical ReturnSettled receipt, librarian sender, requestId, borrower, returnedAt and every emitted amount",
